{"id": "717ab2a3-583e-4974-99ab-3b5cb43ae2b7", "slug": "platform-features-2", "title": "Platform Features", "description": null, "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Platform Features\"\ndescription: \"Nexus Platform's complete subscription plan is curated to integrate seamlessly into your enterprise workflow.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#14B8A6\"\n  secondary: \"#111113\"\n  accent: \"#22D3EE\"\n  background: \"#08080A\"\n  surface: \"#1A1A1C\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Platform Features\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 11; favorites: 1; remixes: 0.\nTags: feature, section, cta, animated, bento.\n## Overview\nPlatform Features is a Neuform Featured template imported as a reusable Aura DESIGN.md system.\n\nNexus Platform's complete subscription plan is curated to integrate seamlessly into your enterprise workflow.\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Comprehensive Subscription Perks.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #14B8A6, secondary #111113, accent #22D3EE, background #08080A, surface #1A1A1C, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Platform Features</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <style>\n        .dot-pattern {\n            background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px);\n            background-size: 16px 16px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#08080a] text-neutral-400 font-sans antialiased min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-8\">\n\n    <div class=\"max-w-5xl w-full flex flex-col gap-6\">\n\n        <!-- Top Card: Subscription Perks -->\n        <div class=\"bg-[#111113] rounded-3xl border border-white/5 overflow-hidden flex flex-col lg:flex-row relative shadow-2xl\">\n            <!-- Glowing Background Effect -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[80%] h-[80%] bg-gradient-to-tr from-emerald-500/20 via-teal-500/5 to-transparent blur-[100px] rounded-full pointer-events-none -translate-x-1/4 translate-y-1/4 z-0\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Left Content -->\n            <div class=\"p-8 md:p-10 lg:w-[45%] relative z-10 flex flex-col justify-center\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:key-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-white mb-5\"></iconify-icon>\n                <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight font-medium mb-6 leading-snug\">Comprehensive<br>Subscription Perks</h2>\n                <div class=\"space-y-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-400/90 font-normal\">\n                    <p>Nexus Platform's complete subscription plan is curated to integrate seamlessly into your enterprise workflow.</p>\n                    <p>Each seat includes a full year of dedicated technical support, updates, upgrades, and access to the latest releases. After 12 months, easily renew your license to continue receiving unwavering support, the latest feature updates, and cutting-edge performance enhancements.</p>\n                    <p>Engineered for excellence — Nexus Platform is your partner in the relentless pursuit of perfection.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Content: Code & Modal -->\n            <div class=\"lg:w-[55%] relative min-h-[400px] lg:min-h-auto bg-[#0a0a0c] border-t lg:border-t-0 lg:border-l border-white/5 p-6 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center\">\n\n                <!-- Code Background -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 p-8 font-mono text-xs leading-loose text-neutral-600 opacity-60 pointer-events-none select-none\">\n                    <p><span class=\"text-indigo-400\">import</span> \"./styles.css\";</p>\n                    <p><span class=\"text-indigo-400\">import</span> { type Config } <span class=\"text-indigo-400\">from</span> \"@nexus-corp/core-types\";</p>\n                    <br>\n                    <p><span class=\"text-indigo-400\">export function</span> <span class=\"text-blue-400\">initializeSystem</span>({ api, row }) {</p>\n                    <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"text-indigo-400\">if</span> (!api.isReady) <span class=\"text-indigo-400\">return null</span>;</p>\n                    <br>\n                    <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"text-indigo-400\">const</span> status = row.status.toUpperCase();</p>\n                    <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"text-indigo-400\">const</span> isActive = status === 'ACTIVE';</p>\n                    <br>\n                    <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"text-indigo-400\">return</span> (</p>\n                    <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;<span class=\"text-emerald-400\">div</span> className=\"nexus-cell\"&gt;</p>\n                    <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;<span class=\"text-emerald-400\">span</span>&gt;{status}&lt;/<span class=\"text-emerald-400\">span</span>&gt;</p>\n                    <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/<span class=\"text-emerald-400\">div</span>&gt;</p>\n                    <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;);</p>\n                    <p>}</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Floating Modal -->\n                <div class=\"relative z-20 w-[360px] bg-[#1a1a1c]/95 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 rounded-2xl shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] overflow-hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"p-5 border-b border-white/5 flex justify-between items-start\">\n                        <div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-white text-sm font-medium tracking-tight mb-1\">Active Seats</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-teal-400 text-xs font-medium\">5 allocated</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center border border-white/5\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:users-group-rounded-linear\" class=\"text-neutral-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"p-2\">\n                        <!-- Table Header -->\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-12 gap-2 px-3 py-2 text-[11px] text-neutral-500 border-b border-white/5 mb-1\">\n                            <div class=\"col-span-4\">Role</div>\n                            <div class=\"col-span-4\">User</div>\n                            <div class=\"col-span-4 text-right\">Status</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <!-- Table Rows -->\n                        <div class=\"space-y-0.5\">\n                            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-12 gap-2 px-3 py-2 text-xs items-center hover:bg-white/[0.02] rounded-lg transition-colors cursor-default\">\n                                <div class=\"col-span-4 text-neutral-500\">Developer</div>\n                                <div class=\"col-span-4 text-neutral-300\">Alice Smith</div>\n                                <div class=\"col-span-4 text-right text-neutral-400\">12 months</div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-12 gap-2 px-3 py-2 text-xs items-center hover:bg-white/[0.02] rounded-lg transition-colors cursor-default\">\n                                <div class=\"col-span-4 text-neutral-500\">Architect</div>\n                                <div class=\"col-span-4 text-neutral-300\">Bob Jones</div>\n                                <div class=\"col-span-4 text-right text-neutral-400\">4 months</div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-12 gap-2 px-3 py-2 text-xs items-center hover:bg-white/[0.02] rounded-lg transition-colors cursor-default\">\n                                <div class=\"col-span-4 text-neutral-500\">Developer</div>\n                                <div class=\"col-span-4 text-neutral-300\">Carol White</div>\n                                <div class=\"col-span-4 text-right text-neutral-400\">28 days</div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-12 gap-2 px-3 py-2 text-xs items-center hover:bg-white/[0.02] rounded-lg transition-colors cursor-default\">\n                                <div class=\"col-span-4 text-neutral-500\">Manager</div>\n                                <div class=\"col-span-4 text-neutral-300\">David Brown</div>\n                                <div class=\"col-span-4 text-right text-neutral-400\">Today</div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-12 gap-2 px-3 py-2 text-xs items-center hover:bg-white/[0.02] rounded-lg transition-colors cursor-default\">\n                                <div class=\"col-span-4 text-neutral-500\">Developer</div>\n                                <div class=\"col-span-4 text-neutral-300\">Eve Davis</div>\n                                <div class=\"col-span-4 text-right text-red-400 flex items-center justify-end gap-1.5\">\n                                    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(239,68,68,0.8)]\"></span> Expired\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Cards Row -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n\n            <!-- Mail Card -->\n            <div class=\"bg-[#111113] rounded-3xl border border-white/5 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden shadow-xl\">\n                <!-- Illustration Area -->\n                <div class=\"h-[200px] relative flex items-center justify-center border-b border-white/5 bg-[#0a0a0c] overflow-hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 dot-pattern opacity-50\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Abstract Envelope Graphic -->\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center\">\n                        <div class=\"w-28 h-20 bg-[#1a1a1c] border border-white/10 rounded-xl shadow-2xl relative flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n                            <!-- Inner document -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-2 w-20 h-24 bg-[#222225] border border-white/5 rounded-t-lg flex flex-col items-center pt-3 gap-2\">\n                                <div class=\"w-8 h-1 bg-teal-500 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(20,184,166,0.4)]\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-12 h-0.5 bg-neutral-600 rounded-full\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-10 h-0.5 bg-neutral-600 rounded-full\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <!-- Envelope flaps simulation -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 border-t border-white/5 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent to-[#1a1a1c] z-10\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <!-- Content -->\n                <div class=\"p-8 relative z-20\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 text-white\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:letter-linear\" class=\"text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium tracking-tight\">Direct Inbox</h3>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-400/90 font-normal\">\n                        <p>\n                            As a subscriber requiring confidential assistance, please fill out a secure request form or email us directly at <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-teal-400 hover:text-teal-300 transition-colors\">help@nexus-corp.com</a>.\n                        </p>\n                        <p>\n                            In your email, include your organization name and unique customer ID for prompt service.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Source Control Card -->\n            <div class=\"bg-[#111113] rounded-3xl border border-white/5 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden shadow-xl\">\n                <!-- Illustration Area -->\n                <div class=\"h-[200px] relative flex items-center justify-center border-b border-white/5 bg-[#0a0a0c] overflow-hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 dot-pattern opacity-50\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Abstract Git Graphic -->\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[240px] h-full flex items-center\">\n                        <div class=\"w-full h-0.5 bg-neutral-800 relative\">\n                            <!-- Branch Line -->\n                            <svg class=\"absolute left-[20%] top-1/2 -translate-y-[calc(100%-1px)] w-20 h-12 text-neutral-800\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 80 48\">\n                                <path d=\"M0 48 C 20 48, 20 0, 80 0\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n                            </svg>\n\n                            <!-- Nodes -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute left-[15%] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-teal-500 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(20,184,166,0.4)] flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                <span class=\"absolute -top-6 text-[10px] text-neutral-500 font-mono bg-[#111113] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/5\">v1.0</span>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"absolute left-[45%] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(34,211,238,0.4)] flex items-center justify-center z-10\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:branching-paths-linear\" class=\"text-neutral-900 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"absolute right-[15%] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-indigo-500 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(99,102,241,0.4)] flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                <span class=\"absolute -top-6 text-[10px] text-neutral-500 font-mono bg-[#111113] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/5\">v2.0</span>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Branch Node -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute left-[45%] top-[-48px] -translate-y-1/2 w-4 h-4 rounded-full border-2 border-neutral-600 bg-[#0a0a0c]\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <!-- Content -->\n                <div class=\"p-8 relative z-20\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 text-white\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:code-circle-linear\" class=\"text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium tracking-tight\">Source Control</h3>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-400/90 font-normal\">\n                        <p>\n                            With your Nexus Platform purchase, you receive 12 months of premium technical support.\n                        </p>\n                        <p>\n                            Subscribers gain access to our private <span class=\"text-teal-400\">Source Control repository</span> to address and track support issues or propose feature requests. Please note you must be authenticated to access the repository.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "platform-features-2.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/platform-features-2.jpg", "source_name": "platform-features-2-DESIGN.md", "views": 52, "forks": 0, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T01:33:49.341679+00:00"}